    markdown:
      "## create\n\n`client.batch.create(key: string, requests?: { query?: string; }[]): { msg?: string; status?: string; track_id?: string; }`\n\n**post** `/batch`\n\nCreate Batch Routing\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `key: string`\n  A key is a unique identifier that is required to authenticate a request to the API.\n\n- `requests?: { query?: string; }[]`\n  An array of objects to collect the details of individual routing queries that will form a batch.\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ msg?: string; status?: string; track_id?: string; }`\n\n  - `msg?: string`\n  - `status?: string`\n  - `track_id?: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport NextbillionSDK from '@nbai/sdk';\n\nconst client = new NextbillionSDK();\n\nconst batch = await client.batch.create({ key: 'key=API_KEY' });\n\nconsole.log(batch);\n```",
