      "## retrieve\n\n`client.batch.retrieve(key: string, track_id: string): { msg?: string; responses?: object[]; status?: string; track_id?: string; }`\n\n**get** `/batch`\n\nGet Batch Result\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `key: string`\n  A key is a unique identifier that is required to authenticate a request to the API.\n\n- `track_id: string`\n  Specify the track ID of the batch that was returned in the response after submitting a successful batch request.\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ msg?: string; responses?: { response?: object; status_code?: number; }[]; status?: string; track_id?: string; }`\n\n  - `msg?: string`\n  - `responses?: { response?: object; status_code?: number; }[]`\n  - `status?: string`\n  - `track_id?: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport NextbillionSDK from '@nbai/sdk';\n\nconst client = new NextbillionSDK();\n\nconst batch = await client.batch.retrieve({ key: 'key=API_KEY', track_id: 'track_id' });\n\nconsole.log(batch);\n```",
