    name: 'retrieve',
    endpoint: '/multigeocode/place/{docId}',
    httpMethod: 'get',
    summary: 'Get Place',
    description:
      'Use this method to get the details of previously created custom places using its NextBillion ID.',
    stainlessPath: '(resource) multigeocode.place > (method) retrieve',
    qualified: 'client.multigeocode.place.retrieve',
    params: ['docId: string;', 'key: string;'],
    response:
      "{ dataSorce?: { refId?: string; source?: string; status?: 'enable' | 'disable'; }; docId?: string; place?: { address?: string; building?: string; city?: string; country?: string; district?: string; geopoint?: object; house?: string; poi?: object; postalCode?: string; state?: string; street?: string; subDistrict?: string; }[]; score?: number; }",
    markdown:
      "## retrieve\n\n`client.multigeocode.place.retrieve(docId: string, key: string): { dataSorce?: object; docId?: string; place?: place_item[]; score?: number; }`\n\n**get** `/multigeocode/place/{docId}`\n\nUse this method to get the details of previously created custom places using its NextBillion ID.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `docId: string`\n\n- `key: string`\n  A key is a unique identifier that is required to authenticate a request to the API.\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ dataSorce?: { refId?: string; source?: string; status?: 'enable' | 'disable'; }; docId?: string; place?: { address?: string; building?: string; city?: string; country?: string; district?: string; geopoint?: object; house?: string; poi?: object; postalCode?: string; state?: string; street?: string; subDistrict?: string; }[]; score?: number; }`\n\n  - `dataSorce?: { refId?: string; source?: string; status?: 'enable' | 'disable'; }`\n  - `docId?: string`\n  - `place?: { address?: string; building?: string; city?: string; country?: string; district?: string; geopoint?: { lat?: number; lng?: number; }; house?: string; poi?: { title?: string; }; postalCode?: string; state?: string; street?: string; subDistrict?: string; }[]`\n  - `score?: number`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport NextbillionSDK from '@nbai/sdk';\n\nconst client = new NextbillionSDK();\n\nconst place = await client.multigeocode.place.retrieve('docId', { key: 'key=API_KEY' });\n\nconsole.log(place);\n```",
