    qualified: 'client.routeReport.create',
    params: ['key: string;', 'original_shape: string;', "original_shape_type: 'polyline' | 'polyline6';"],
    response:
      '{ geometry?: string[]; mileage?: { segment?: { country?: object[]; state?: object[]; }; summary?: { country?: object; state?: object; }; }[]; msg?: string; road_summary?: { segment?: { max_speed?: object[]; road_class?: object[]; }; summary?: { distance?: number; duration?: number; has_bridge?: boolean; has_roundabout?: boolean; has_toll?: boolean; has_tunnel?: boolean; road_class?: object; toll_distance?: number; }; }[]; status?: string; }',
    markdown:
      "## create\n\n`client.routeReport.create(key: string, original_shape: string, original_shape_type: 'polyline' | 'polyline6'): { geometry?: string[]; mileage?: object[]; msg?: string; road_summary?: object[]; status?: string; }`\n\n**post** `/route_report`\n\nRoute Report\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `key: string`\n  A key is a unique identifier that is required to authenticate a request to the API.\n\n- `original_shape: string`\n  Takes a route geometry as input and returns the route details. Accepts polyline and polyline6 encoded geometry as input.\n\n**Note**: Route geometries generated from sources other than [NextBillion.ai](http://NextBillion.ai) services, are not supported in this version.\n\n- `original_shape_type: 'polyline' | 'polyline6'`\n  Specify the encoding type of route geometry provided in original_shape input. Please note that an error is returned when this parameter is not specified while an input is added to original_shape parameter.\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ geometry?: string[]; mileage?: { segment?: { country?: object[]; state?: object[]; }; summary?: { country?: object; state?: object; }; }[]; msg?: string; road_summary?: { segment?: { max_speed?: object[]; road_class?: object[]; }; summary?: { distance?: number; duration?: number; has_bridge?: boolean; has_roundabout?: boolean; has_toll?: boolean; has_tunnel?: boolean; road_class?: object; toll_distance?: number; }; }[]; status?: string; }`\n\n  - `geometry?: string[]`\n  - `mileage?: { segment?: { country?: { distance?: number; length?: number; offset?: number; value?: string; }[]; state?: { distance?: number; length?: number; offset?: number; value?: string; }[]; }; summary?: { country?: object; state?: object; }; }[]`\n  - `msg?: string`\n  - `road_summary?: { segment?: { max_speed?: { distance?: number; length?: number; offset?: number; value?: number; }[]; road_class?: { distance?: number; length?: number; offset?: number; value?: string; }[]; }; summary?: { distance?: number; duration?: number; has_bridge?: boolean; has_roundabout?: boolean; has_toll?: boolean; has_tunnel?: boolean; road_class?: object; toll_distance?: number; }; }[]`\n  - `status?: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport NextbillionSDK from '@nbai/sdk';\n\nconst client = new NextbillionSDK();\n\nconst routeReport = await client.routeReport.create({\n  key: 'key=API_KEY',\n  original_shape: 'original_shape=sbp}_AlmgpFnLuToKmKviB{eDlcGhpFvj@qbAwoA_mA',\n  original_shape_type: 'polyline',\n});\n\nconsole.log(routeReport);\n```",
